  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2020/03/ClinicaPodolympicsOnda-1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(17 fotos) Ha abierto sus puertas <a href=\"https://www.podolympics.com/\" target=\"_blank\">la cl&iacute;nica Podolympics en la avenida Pa&iacute;s Valenci&agrave;, 45 de Onda</a>, con Elisa Romero Olucha, pod&oacute;loga y fisioterapeuta, al frente. Tambi&eacute;n hay servicio de nutrici&oacute;n y biomec&aacute;nica, con la novedad de plantillas a medida realizadas con impresora 3D.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/podolympics/clinicapodolympicsonda-1.jpg\" alt=\"clinicapodolympicsonda-1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/podolympics/clinicapodolympicsonda-2.jpg\" alt=\"clinicapodolympicsonda-2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/podolympics/clinicapodolympicsonda-3.jpg\" alt=\"clinicapodolympicsonda-3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/podolympics/clinicapodolympicsonda-4.jpg\" alt=\"clinicapodolympicsonda-4\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/podolympics/clinicapodolympicsonda-5.jpg\" alt=\"clinicapodolympicsonda-5\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/podolympics/img_8028.jpg\" alt=\"img_8028\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/podolympics/img_8029.jpg\" alt=\"img_8029\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/podolympics/img_8034.jpg\" alt=\"img_8034\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img